      "label": "Notes",
      "props": {
        "text": "Run mode models driver location writes (gateway to the geo index primaries), nearby-driver queries (dispatch to the replicas) and trip requests plus state changes (dispatch to Postgres, where assignment is a conditional update). Maps calls, pushes, route recording, surge and payments are drawn but carry no run-mode traffic. Sized for the 2x evening peak (1M drivers online, 250,000 updates/s) with one zone lost: 48 gateway and 27 dispatch instances."
      }
